{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32881","headline":"下第後屏居书怀寄张侍御 · 李频","name":"下第後屏居书怀寄张侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刖足岂一生，良工隔千里。\n故山彭泽上，归梦向汾水。\n低催神气尽，僮仆心亦耻。\n未达谁不知，达者多忘此。\n行年忽已壮，去老年更几。\n功名如不彰，身殁岂爲鬼。\n才看芳草歇，即叹凉风起。\n骢马未来朝，嘶声尚在耳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}